        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI Satin Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSatin stainless steel finished single cylinder deadbolt (keyed on the outside and thumb turn on the inside). These security deadbolts now have a adjustable deadbolt latch, fits 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and standard pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/satin-stainless-steel-double-cylinder-deadbolt-ahi-4660\"><b>Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the AHI Satin Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>20 Minute UL Fire Rated</li>\r\n<li>6 Pin Schlage C Keyway for Security</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Latch for 2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\" Backset </li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core for Extra Security</li>\r\n<li>Fit Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AHI 4650 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b> Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rosette Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
